Edit a room property in an interactive editor.

usage: @edit <roomid> <property>

Opens the named property of a room for editing. The property must
already exist on the room. Your changes are saved back to the room when
you finish in the editor.

Requires the web client or an MCP-capable client. It is not available
from a plain telnet session. See also @view.

Example:
  @edit tower-entrance desc.long    Edit the room's long description.
